1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,000
As a lecturer, Lam has to navigate fragmented information across the university every week.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:11,500
Student results and private messages. Teaching assistants' notes. Attendance records and learning activity.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Each source holds a piece of the story. None tells the whole story.

4
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:22,500
And the students who need help most can be the hardest to see: the quiet ones, gradually disengaging, at risk of dropping out.

5
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,500
Beyond brings every source into one intelligent system.

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:33,000
When Lam logs in, the classroom is already summarised: who's falling behind, and who needs individual support.

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,000
The Classroom maintains a dynamic learning twin for every student.

8
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:43,500
Fifty-five students, each represented through an evolving model of their knowledge and progress.

9
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:47,500
One of them stands out: Minh Anh.

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,500
Lam asks why her quiz score dropped.

11
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Two specialized agents get to work: one understands the learner; the other determines how teaching should respond.

12
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:08,500
The diagnosis is grounded in her own work. The decline traces back to one concept: logical implication. Every finding links to its supporting evidence.

13
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Her digital twin reveals where the learning gaps remain.

14
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:19,000
Then Lam looks beyond one student. Is this an individual problem, or a pattern across the class?

15
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:23,000
The system reveals a shared gap in prerequisite knowledge.

16
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:27,000
The agents collaboratively propose a four-session intervention.

17
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:30,500
Lam stays in control: review, adjust and approve.

18
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:34,500
Moments later, the plan is on Minh Anh's phone.

19
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:38,000
The AI coordinates. The teacher governs.

20
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:43,000
At five o'clock, Minh Anh opens her plan.

21
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:51,000
She confuses the converse with the original implication. A targeted hint shows her why.

22
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:55,000
Then guided practice, with support that gradually fades.

23
00:01:55,500 --> 00:01:58,500
Her estimated mastery rises from thirty-one to fifty-two percent.

24
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,500
That evening, she completes her mastery check.

25
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:07,500
Within Lam's policy, a follow-up is already scheduled for tomorrow.

26
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:12,500
Her progress updates the classroom picture, revealing who still needs support.

27
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:18,000
Behind it all is one integrated intelligence architecture.

28
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:25,500
Multimodal models interpret diverse data. Knowledge graphs ground the reasoning. Digital twins track each learner's evolving state.

29
00:02:26,500 --> 00:02:32,000
Specialized agents reason, coordinate and adapt interventions based on what happens next.

30
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:38,000
Beyond AI tutoring. Intelligent intervention, with teachers in control.
